WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.698
A matrix is a rectangular table of numbers.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:21.113
You can add matrices entry by entry when their sizes match. To multiply two matrices,

00:00:21.113 --> 00:00:28.050
the number of columns in the first must equal the number of rows in the second.

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:38.242
For a two by two matrix, the determinant is a times d minus b times c.
